%% T3 — Issue detection and the improvement loop
flowchart TD
    A[Batch of records] --> B[Detect issues]
    B --> C[Assign code and group]
    C --> D{Remedy class}
    D -->|rule or enrichment| E[Automated remediation]
    D -->|steward only| F[Steward queue]
    E --> G[Re-audit enriched batch]
    F --> G
    G --> H[Measure reduction]
    H --> I[Revise rules and tiers]
    I --> B
